msgstr "Two-step protection (2FA) was turned on for your account."

msgid "Ikki bosqichli himoya o‘chirildi"
msgstr "Two-step protection disabled"

msgid "Hisobingizda ikki bosqichli himoya (2FA) o‘chirildi. Endi hisob faqat parol bilan himoyalangan."
msgstr "Two-step protection (2FA) was turned off for your account. It is now protected by a password only."

msgid "Zaxira kodlar yangilandi"
msgstr "Backup codes regenerated"

msgid "Hisobingizning zaxira kodlari yangilandi; eskilari bekor qilindi."
msgstr "The backup codes of your account were regenerated; the old ones are no longer valid."

msgid "2FA administrator tomonidan tiklandi"
msgstr "2FA reset by an administrator"

msgid "Hisobingizning ikki bosqichli himoyasi administrator tomonidan olib tashlandi. Keyingi kirishda uni qayta sozlaysiz."
msgstr "The two-step protection of your account was removed by an administrator. You will set it up again at your next sign-in."

msgid "Xodimlar portaliga taklif"
msgstr "Invitation to the staff portal"

msgid "Siz uchun xodimlar portalida hisob yaratildi."
msgstr "An account was created for you on the staff portal."

